{"title":"Axis","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><i>Axis</i> may refer to\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Y-axis\" title=\"Y-axis\">y-axis</a>, the vertical line in a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Coordinate_plane\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Coordinate plane\">coordinate plane</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=X-axis\" title=\"X-axis\">x-axis</a>, the horizontal line in a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Coordinate_plane\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Coordinate plane\">coordinate plane</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Semimajor_axis\" title=\"Semimajor axis\">Semimajor axis</a>, the longer <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Semidiameter\" title=\"Semidiameter\">semidiameter</a> of a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Conic_section\" title=\"Conic section\">conic section</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Semiminor_axis\" title=\"Semiminor axis\">Semiminor axis</a>, the shorter <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Semidiameter\" title=\"Semidiameter\">semidiameter</a> of a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Conic_section\" title=\"Conic section\">conic section</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Major_axis\" title=\"Major axis\">Major axis</a>, the longer <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Diameter\" title=\"Diameter\">diameter</a> of a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Conic_section\" title=\"Conic section\">conic section</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Minor_axis\" title=\"Minor axis\">Minor axis</a>, the shorter <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Diameter\" title=\"Diameter\">diameter</a> of a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Conic_section\" title=\"Conic section\">conic section</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Real_axis\" title=\"Real axis\">Real axis</a>, the horizontal line in the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Complex_plane\" title=\"Complex plane\">complex plane</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Imaginary_axis\" title=\"Imaginary axis\">Imaginary axis</a>, the vertical line in the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Complex_plane\" title=\"Complex plane\">complex plane</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Radical_axis\" title=\"Radical axis\">Radical axis</a>, a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Geometry\" title=\"Geometry\">geometric</a> method involving circles</li></ul>\n<hr />\n<p><i>This is a disambiguation page.  The title you requested could refer to one of the articles listed on this page.</i>\n</p><p>If you were referred to this page through an <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Special:WhatLinksHere/Axis\" title=\"Special:WhatLinksHere/Axis\">internal link</a> and you believe that a direct link to a specific article would be more appropriate, feel free to help us out by changing the link on that page.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018074112\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.013 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.018 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 392/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.318      1 Template:Disambig\n100.00%    5.318      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:23651:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018074112 and revision id 249163. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}